      "BaseColor stays free of baked lighting, AO, specular highlights, dust, peeling grime, and full-surface noise.",
      "SMK.R is selective detail permission; SMK.G is only explicitly authored structure; SMK.B is low-frequency variation.",
      "Unused alpha is not stored. Normal maps are omitted when the revised albedo has no justified matching normal source."
    ],
    "forbidden": [
      "high-frequency noise over the whole surface",
      "photographic micro wood grain",
      "cloth weave or automatic furniture cavity",
      "light, AO, or shadow baked into BaseColor"
    ]
  },
